\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm v\u7873\'3f ch\'ednh s\'e1ch, ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897
\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f \u7903\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7885\'3fc, b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn, Vi\u7879\'3fn nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc; B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3f
ng d\u7851\'3fn v\u7873\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm cho c\'e1c ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f, ch\'ednh s\'e1ch \'f0\'f3 nh\'fd sau:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 1. \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng:
\par \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng c\'e1c ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi th\'f4ng tri s\u7889\'3f 08-TT/TCTW ng\'e0y  17/3/1987 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 
\'f0i\u7875\'3fm v\u7873\'3f ch\'ednh s\'e1ch, ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h
\u7885\'3fc, b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn, Vi\u7879\'3fn nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc, \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch, c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ki\'eam nhi\u7879\'3fm c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng, c\'f4
ng t\'e1c \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng \'d0\u7843\'3fng, c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7885\'3fc, b\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fn, Vi\u7879\'3fn nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897
\'3fc c\'e1c l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\u361\'3f trang kh\'f4ng \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 2. Ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 a) Ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp, tr\u7907\'3f c\u7845\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch, kho\u7843
\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ki\u7875\'3fm nhi\u7879\'3fm c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng \u7903\'3f c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7885\'3fc, b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn, Vi\u7879\'3fn nghi\'ean c
\u7913\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc do Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'d0\u7843\'3fng \'f0\'e0i th\u7885\'3f. Ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp, tr\u7907\'3f c\u7845\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch, kho
\u7843\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ki\'eam nhi\u7879\'3fm c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f (c\'f4ng \'f0o\'e0n, \'f0o\'e0n thanh ni\'ean) do Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\u7911\'3fa \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875
\'3f c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\'e0i th\u7885\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823  theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\'e2n c\u7845\'3fp qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch hi\u7879\'3fn h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'e0nh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 b) Ti\u7873\'3fn th\'fd\u7903\'3fng:
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7885\'3fc, b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn, Vi\u7879\'3fn nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu khoa h\u7885\'3fc l\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f h\'e0nh ch\'ednh s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp, kh\'f4
ng c\'f3 qu\u7929\'3f ph\'fac l\u7907\'3fi v\'e0 qu\u7929\'3f khen th\'fd\u7903\'3fng th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'ec c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch c\'f4ng t\'e1c }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn th\'fd\u7903\'3fng theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, c
\'f4ng nh\'e2n vi\'ean ch\u7913\'3fc h\'e0nh ch\'ednh- s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp. Kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn th\'fd\u7903\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh trong k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\u7911\'3fa \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th
\u7875\'3f.
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7885\'3fc, b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn, Vi\'ean nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu c\'f3 qu\u7929\'3f ph\'fac l\u7907\'3fi v\'e0 qu\u7929\'3f khen th\'fd\u7903\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch l\u7853
\'3fp theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'ec c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch c\u361\'75ng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fnn ti\u7873\'3fn th\'fd\u7903\'3fng nh\'fd c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f c\'f4ng nh\'e2n vi\'ean ch\u7913\'3fc t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0ang c\'f4
ng t\'e1c.
\par c) Th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f n\'f5i c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch c\'f4ng t\'e1c c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm c\'e1c \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy
\'ean tr\'e1ch c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f ho\'e0n th\'e0nh nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc giao nh\'fd: V\'e3n ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'f2ng ph\u7849
\'3fm, c\'f4ng t\'e1c ph\'ed v.v...; C\'e1c ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn v\u7873\'3f nh\'e0 \u7903\'3f, trang b\u7883\'3f }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'f0\u7891\'3f d\'f9ng sinh ho\u7841\'3ft theo ch\u7871
\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f do Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 c\'e1c quy\u7873\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi v\u7873\'3f v\'e3n ho\'e1, ph\'fac l\u7907\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng nh\'fd \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f c\'f4
ng nh\'e2n vi\'ean kh\'e1c c\'f9ng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f. Ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo c\'e1c nhu c\u7847\'3fu chi ti\'eau n\'f3i tr\'ean do \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\'e0i th\u7885\'3f, kh\'f4ng t\'ednh trong ng\'e2n s\'e1ch 
\'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 3. C\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 - K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng (bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp, tr\u7907\'3f c\u7845\'3f
p) c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch v\'e0 kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ki\'eam nhi\u7879\'3fm c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f do c\'f5 quan \'d0
\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm l\u7853\'3fp h\'e0ng qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'fd, h\'e0nh n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'e3m v\'e0 t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp chung v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\u7911\'3fa \'d0\u7843\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f. Qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c c\'f5
 quan \'d0\u7843\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc TW v\'e0 c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng \'d0\u7843\'3fng b\u7897\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Ban t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc TW v\'e0 Ban t\'e0i ch\'ednh qu\u7843\'3fn tr
\u7883\'3f TW vi\u7879\'3ft; qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc TW v\'e0 c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'d0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng ph
\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ban ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'f3 \u7903\'3f c\u7845\'3fp TW duy\u7879\'3ft.
\par - C\'f5 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t kho\u7843\'3fn tr\u7907\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ng\'e2n s\'e1ch cho c\'e1c c\'f5 quan \'d0\u7843\'3fng (theo th\'f4ng b\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa Ban t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913
\'3fc TW v\'e0 Ban t\'e0i ch\'ednh - qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f TW) v\'e0 cho c\'e1c \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f (theo th\'f4ng b\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa Ban ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh c\'e1c \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f \u7903\'3f c\u7845\'3fp TW) \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7843
\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7911\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f chuy\'ean tr\'e1ch (ho\u7863\'3fc cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ki\'eam nhi\u7879\'3fm) c\'f4ng t\'e1c \'d0\u7843\'3fng, \'f0o\'e0n th\u7875\'3f.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af575 \ltrch\fcs0 \f575\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'fd. Nh\u7919\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y \'f0\u7873\'3fu b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'e3i b\u7887\'3f.
\par Trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn, c\'f3 g\'ec v}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af583 \ltrch\fcs0 \f583\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1077856\charrsid11293823 \'fd\u7899\'3fng m\u7855\'3fc, \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1
nh v\u7899\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu, gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft.
\par \ltrrow}\trowd \irow0\irowband0\lastrow \ltrrow\ts11\trgaph108\trleft-108\trftsWidth2\trwWidth5000\trftsWidthB3\trftsWidthA3\trautofit1\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\tblrsid7344678\tblind0\tblindtype3 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrnone \clbrdrl
